This question tests practical knowledge of cache locality, lock-free memory pools, and safe reclamation in NUMA-aware systems.

## Key Concepts
- Cache-friendly per-thread allocators
- Lock-free free lists and batch transfers
- NUMA awareness and false sharing avoidance
- Hazard pointers / epoch-based reclamation

